# Logs
# Anchored to the root: an unanchored "logs" also matched source folders such
# as src/components/logs, silently keeping them out of the repo.
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
*.local.*

# This project uses pnpm (see packageManager in package.json). A stray
# `npm install` used to leave a package-lock.json behind, which then blocked
# `git pull` on machines that had one. Ignore the lockfiles we do not use.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
